virtio-gpu: 3D through virglrenderer ("-s N,virtio-gpu,3d=on[,hostmem=MiB]")

Built only with make VIRGL=PREFIX (KEEL_VTGPU_3D): every control command goes to
hvf/pci_virtio_gpu_3d.c first; commands it answers later (a fence with a ring index)
keep their chain until vtgpu_h_complete(); a blob scanout is copied to the shm by
vtgpu_h_present(); the device config says how many capsets; BAR 4 is the
host-visible memory window, its address follows pe_baraddr.

